      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然不知道她为什么要这样问，\n不过当我回头时，曼城茶座已经\n在我不知道的时候消失无踪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da1148fa63981fcd97f9896dd5e7a76626de782376ef91a20ebd329fb920c65a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0157/storytimeline_830157001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c56e3036a8ac0671f9534da7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在爱丽速子她们靠近之前，\n曼城茶座就潜下去了，\n我有听见小小的水声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9e0c464b1f81623bf8053ef685354c418d0f06ea6f3657ecabae8435eeafc6a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
