      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喜欢安静的茶座，现在一定\n不想见到任何人吧。\n我决定帮茶座隐瞒她躲起来的事──",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d8e282c3fbb4ace1eaf23a61a0392eb1ab886591777be5867e633b2110e4983",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
